# The malformed task may be the exclusive one, so partial output would leave the
# same hole open. Nothing is printed, including the two tasks read before it —
# zzz sorts last, so the refusal has to reach back over work already done.
run available
exit 3
file tasks/M1-01.md
	---
	id: M1-01
	depends_on: []
	exclusive: no
	---
file tasks/M1-02.md
	---
	id: M1-02
	depends_on: []
	exclusive: no
	---
file tasks/zzz.md
	---
	id: Z
	depends_on: []
	exclusive: maybe
	---
stderr
	tasks.sh: tasks/zzz.md: exclusive must be yes or no, found: maybe
